504
00:25:52.730 --> 00:25:53.910
And I was like, oh, they weren't there.

505
00:25:54.250 --> 00:25:54.710
Yeah.

506
00:25:54.890 --> 00:25:58.750
So it was, it was fun to just, I forgot about that whole thing.

