516
00:26:31.670 --> 00:26:31.950
That's right.

517
00:26:32.250 --> 00:26:34.830
Super relaxed and just like having the best time.

518
00:26:34.970 --> 00:26:36.210
And then they got four days off.

519
00:26:36.330 --> 00:26:40.650
And we were, we were just like, hey, I forgot about that.

