At 20 minutes, 34 seconds, after he's finished singing and it pans to the crowd and everyone cheers,

1654
01:25:33.060 --> 01:25:35.980
you and I are sitting side by side on the floor together.

1655
01:25:36.860 --> 01:25:38.640
Oh, my gosh, Angela.

1656
01:25:38.900 --> 01:25:40.900
